
## CREATE ROOM 
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/room/create 
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


{
  "roomNumber": 204,
  "capacity": 2,
  "floorNumber": 2
}

### SEED ROOMS: 8 floors x 10 rooms (101-110, 201-210, ... 801-810)
# @loop for 80
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/room/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "RoomNumber": {{ (Math.floor($index / 10) + 1) * 100 + ($index % 10) + 1 }},
    "FloorNumber": {{ Math.floor($index / 10) + 1 }},
    "Capacity": 2
}